{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>In order to show you My power.</b> And He did not mention His might (גבורותיו), for He did not show the greatness of His mighty acts in Egypt, but in the future His mighty acts will be great. And Ezekiel, in the vision of the Temple, used the form הראותכה with the addition of the letter ה, as he said (Ezekiel 40:4): ״למען הראותכה הובאתה הנה״ and so forth; and the reason is that in Egypt He showed only a portion of His power and His mighty acts, and in the time to come He will show more and more; or the letter ה may allude to the return of the Shekhinah."], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:57:12.900007710Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}